  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Good Financial Governance in Zambia IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;The action aims to support the Government of the Republic of Zambia (GRZ) to implement its planned integrated public financial management (PFM) reform strategy aimed at restoring fiscal sustainability and improving efficiency and effectiveness of public resource allocation, and spending, for better public service delivery. This action contributes to GFG-IV, also supported by Germany and USAID, and implemented by the GIZ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
